<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant bandits killed leader Kachalla Bello while the DSS uncovered guns smuggled from Niger on camels in Sokoto, and violence in northern Nigeria forced tens of thousands of civilians to flee into Niger. In Mali, a court ruled in favor of Emir Sanusi in a Fulani power struggle and jihadist groups continue to govern parts of the country. Chad forces suffered 23 soldier deaths, including a company commander, in fierce fighting over the Tibesti gold mines. 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9nbXFMQ3VGb1NoQmhSRlh0dUdpU1ZGVm44MVRxZFNGODFuVmp1RjRGR2hLYzZnUWpUWWpoV0RieWpCZ0lYVXJwR1ZMTlgtOThMdmVTcUhveElmcEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE80d3NEWGxjV2FCeF9yaUVDeHF1djFZVlVYbjBYbkpmSUVXTU4teF9YV2VEZXRDT0dRNFFkb0RVN0diV0JmdFVKYXpubDQ3VVdRMGhtZ2Vjd1lPT1NpMEJZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Nigerian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPMFZyZnJwRmVoRVRrZE9oTUMyYUh5N19nWk9fd2J1a3poMXZ3bGNfLTNFNXFKTVU2RGh1UUNiVGhjcHJ6UmJ5UDhxM1lpNHlMSmtWOUNmR1BSZzJQNS1RMDJ1bElTUmxjVUk1aVY4UjF6b0lMR1lGNWZHTlEwRllVaDJsZzdvdTM0N1dGdTVvd014WjNZSVktMGpkYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQWEpKZWNfano2bEstN3gwd1VEUmh4dk9xcEM4NXBIVTBDOGg3RjVINjUxeDVPSDJ3Q1I3X293by1telJYU3B1UmtmSmo3aWZIYUZ2